OL,3,GNEWSA'Serious concerns' prompt
OL,4,Adisability charity probe
OL,5,
OL,6,FA disability charity's work is at risk
OL,7,Fof being brought to a halt because of
OL,8,Fan internal dispute, a regulator has
OL,9,Fwarned.
OL,11,FThe Charity Commission has launched an
OL,12,Finvestigation into "serious concerns"
OL,13,Fabout the management of Adapt (North
OL,14,FEast) following allegations of
OL,15,F"significant" payments being made
OL,16,Fwithout full approval of trustees.
OL,18,FAdapt's chief executive Hannah
OL,19,FHarniess, who joined a year ago, said
OL,20,Fshe raised concerns about financial
OL,21,Farrangements.
OL,23,APub: 27-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
