OL,3,GNEWSA'Serious concerns' prompt
OL,4,Adisability charity probe
OL,5,
OL,6,FBased in Hexham, Adapt provides
OL,7,Fcommunity transport, wheelchair hire
OL,8,Fand other help for people with sensory,
OL,9,Fphysical and learning disabilities in
OL,10,FNorthumberland, Tyneside, Sunderland
OL,11,Fand Durham.
